<title>USA: Capstone Capital Q1 March 31 full results.</title>
<headline>Capstone Capital Q1 March 31 full results.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						 3/31/97     3/31/96</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p> Rental income				$9,680	$6,519</p>
<p>Mortgage interest income</p>
<p>  and other income			   1,604	   916</p>
<p> Total revenues			     11,284	 7,435</p>
<p>Expenses:</p>
<p> General and administrative		  556	   329</p>
<p> Depreciation and amortization	   1,786	 1,352</p>
<p> Interest					2,551	 1,615</p>
<p> Property operations			   146	     -</p>
<p> Total expenses				5,039	 3,296</p>
<p> Net income				    6,245	 4,139</p>
<p> Funds from operations		     7,377	 4,966</p>
<p>Per share amounts (primary):</p>
<p> Net income				     0.43	  0.42</p>
<p> Funds from operations			0.51	  0.50</p>
<p>Per share amounts (diluted):</p>
<p> Net income				     0.43	  0.41</p>
<p> Funds from operations			0.51	  0.48</p>
<p> Dividends per share (A)		   0.470	 0.445</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding:</p>
<p> Primary					14,522	 9,934</p>
<p> Diluted					16,253	12,839</p>
<p>Note: (A) Dividends per share are those declared with respect to such period.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Capstone Capital Corp.</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
